/* 订单信息：每条一张白卡（圆角 8、内边距 16）；头部标题 + 时间同行，脚部细线分隔、绿色「查看订单」。 */
.order-messages-page { min-height:100vh; box-sizing:border-box; padding:var(--xy-layout-card-stack-start-gap) var(--xy-space-4) calc(var(--xy-space-6) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); background:var(--xy-color-page); color:var(--xy-color-text-primary); }
.message-list { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:var(--xy-space-3); }
.order-message { position:relative; min-height:var(--xy-size-touch-min); padding:var(--xy-space-4) var(--xy-space-4) 0; box-sizing:border-box; border:0; border-radius:var(--xy-radius-container); background:var(--xy-color-surface); }
.order-message:active { background:var(--xy-color-surface-subtle); }
.order-message-body { min-width:0; }

.message-head { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:var(--xy-space-3); min-width:0; }
.message-type { display:flex; flex:1; align-items:center; min-width:0; color:var(--xy-color-text-strong); font-size:var(--xy-text-item-title-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-item-title-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.message-type::before { flex:none; width:var(--xy-space-2); height:var(--xy-space-2); margin-right:var(--xy-space-2); border-radius:50%; background:var(--xy-color-brand); content:''; }
.message-time { flex:none; color:var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); white-space:nowrap; }

.message-context { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:var(--xy-space-2); min-width:0; margin-top:var(--xy-space-3); padding:var(--xy-space-2) var(--xy-space-3); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-md); background:var(--xy-color-page); }
.device-name { flex:1; min-width:0; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; color:var(--xy-color-text-primary); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.status-text { flex:none; max-width:50%; padding:0 var(--xy-inset-chip-compact-x); box-sizing:border-box; border-radius:var(--xy-radius-sm); background:var(--xy-color-brand-soft); color:var(--xy-color-brand); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.message-content { display:block; margin-top:var(--xy-space-3); color:var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-line-height); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }

.message-footer { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:var(--xy-space-2); min-height:var(--xy-size-touch-min); margin-top:var(--xy-space-3); border-top:1rpx solid var(--xy-color-divider); color:var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); }
.message-order-id { flex:1; min-width:0; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.message-arrow { display:flex; flex:none; align-items:center; gap:var(--xy-gap-label-value-compact); color:var(--xy-color-brand); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.message-arrow image { width:var(--xy-size-icon-base); height:var(--xy-size-icon-base); }

/* 未登录 / 空态 */
.state-card { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; padding:var(--xy-space-6) var(--xy-space-4); border:0; border-radius:var(--xy-radius-container); background:var(--xy-color-surface); box-shadow:none; text-align:center; }
.state-symbol { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--xy-color-brand-soft); }
.state-symbol image { width:var(--xy-size-icon-row); height:var(--xy-size-icon-row); }
.state-title { margin-top:var(--xy-space-3); color:var(--xy-color-text-strong); font-size:var(--xy-text-section-title-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-section-title-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.state-button { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:var(--xy-size-touch-min); margin-top:var(--xy-space-4); padding:0 var(--xy-space-6); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-md); background:var(--xy-color-action-primary); color:var(--xy-color-text-inverse); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.empty-card.xy-empty-page { min-height:360px; padding:var(--xy-space-6) var(--xy-space-4); }
.empty-card .xy-empty-page__illustration { width:200px; height:150px; margin-bottom:var(--xy-space-3); }
